  "translation": "Na olgeta Yisrael, bilong wanem king i no harim ol, ol manmeri i bekim ⟨את⟩ king tok olsem: Wanem hap bilong mipela i stap long David? No gat wanpela hap bilong mipela long pikinini bilong Yishai. Yisrael, olgeta man, yu go long haus sel bilong yu! Nau, lukluk ⟨em⟩ long haus bilong yu, David! Na olgeta Yisrael i go long ol haus sel bilong ol.",
